This work is inspired by and deeply indebted to the original "Kara the programmable
ladybird" microworld conceived and developed by Raimond Reichert, Jürg Nievergelt,
and Werner Hartmann at ETH Zürich / SwissEduc.

  Original Kara project: https://www.swisseduc.ch/informatik/karatojava/

KaraWeb is not officially affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the original
